<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto">Please note some of the data you are pulling will not require daily syncs as it does not change drastically, i.e. TaxType/Get can be cached to reduce the amount of calls made to
 it.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto">To ensure you get a proper estimate, please consider the use for each endpoint and the total amount of actions each endpoint has will be your daily frequency.<o:p></o:p></p>
